  "headline": "Jujutsu Kaisen season 3 takes a short break after six episodes",
  "description": "The latest season of Jujutsu Kaisen is pausing after episode six, with a recap special scheduled for February 19 and new episodes set to resume on February 26, according to reports citing the series' official updates.",
  "articleBody": "Reports covering official updates say Jujutsu Kaisen season 3 is entering a short break after its sixth episode. The pause is positioned as a brief production gap, with the broadcast schedule shifting for a recap installment that revisits the new season's early events.\n\nThe recap special is slated for February 19 and is expected to include newly recorded narration. Regular broadcast is then set to resume on February 26, allowing the season to continue its current storyline without a long delay.\n\nMultiple outlets note that the season is still on track for a late-March finale, with March 26 cited as the end date for this run. The current arc focuses on the first phase of the Culling Game storyline and will continue once the break concludes.",
